OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque honour for poet's
OL,4,Achildhood home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man who wrote Prime Minister Andy
OL,7,FBurnham's favourite poem has been
OL,8,Fhonoured with a blue plaque in his home
OL,9,Fcity.
OL,11,FPoet Tony Harrison grew up in Leeds and
OL,12,Fis best known for his poem called V,
OL,13,Fwhich was inspired by the graffiti and
OL,14,Fempty beer cans he saw at Holbeck
OL,15,FCemetery where his ashes were later
OL,16,Fburied following his death, aged 88, in
OL,17,FSeptember last year.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
