OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque honour for poet's
OL,4,Achildhood home
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarrison's daughter Jane and partner
OL,7,FSian Thomas, along with Labour MP
OL,8,FRichard Burgon, unveiled the plaque at
OL,9,FThe Hamara Healthy Living Centre in
OL,10,FBeeston, across the street from the
OL,11,Fpoet's former home at 120 Tempest Road.
OL,13,FThomas said: "I know Tony would be so
OL,14,Fthrilled and moved to have this blue
OL,15,Fplaque on his childhood home."
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
